{"slug": "clarity-16-1-3-key-user-experience-enhancements", "title": "Clarity 16.1.3 – Key User Experience Enhancements", "category": "Clarity", "categorySlug": "clarity", "date": "Aug 25, 2023", "author": "admin", "image": "https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262959/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/banner2-ezgif.com-jpg-to-webp-converter.webp", "excerpt": "Broadcom has announced the release of Clarity 16.1.3, introducing many new features around blueprints, visualizations, roadmaps, and hierarchies.", "readTime": 3, "content": "<ul class=\"post-info\">\n                                            <li style=\"list-style:none;padding-bottom:0\"></li>\n                                            <li style=\"list-style:none;padding-bottom:0\"></li>\n                                        </ul>\n                                    </div> -->\n                                    \n<p>Broadcom released the latest version of Clarity 16.1.3 on 21st Aug 2023 with an extensive list of enhancements and features packaged in the release. Here are a few important enhancements from a usability perspective that make the end-user experience better in 16.1.3.</p>\n<p><b>Blueprint Enhancements: </b></p>\n<p><b>Canvas on Roadmaps</b></p>\n<p>Canvas option enabled for Roadmaps that lets you create and configure a canvas on the Roadmap. The canvas created will be available as a new tab on Roadmaps that can be configured.</p>\n<p><b><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1683 size-full\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262926/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas1-203x300-1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"203\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262926/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas1-203x300-1.webp 203w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262924/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas1-203x300-1-37x55.webp 37w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262923/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas1-203x300-1-200x296.webp 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 203px) 100vw, 203px\" /> <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1684 size-full\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262922/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas-2-768x192-1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"192\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262922/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas-2-768x192-1.webp 768w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262921/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas-2-768x192-1-300x75.webp 300w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262919/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas-2-768x192-1-175x44.webp 175w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262920/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas-2-768x192-1-200x50.webp 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></b></p>\n<p>The layout of the canvas can be chosen based on the preferred viewing options.</p>\n<p><b><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1686 size-full\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262931/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas3.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"834\" height=\"304\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262931/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas3.webp 834w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262929/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas3-300x109.webp 300w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262930/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas3-768x280.webp 768w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262927/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas3-151x55.webp 151w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262928/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas3-200x73.webp 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 834px) 100vw, 834px\" /></b></p>\n<p>Different widgets and fields can be arranged in the canvas configured on the Roadmap by a simple drag and drop.</p>\n<p><b><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1687 size-full\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262937/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas4.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"774\" height=\"408\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262937/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas4.webp 774w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262934/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas4-300x158.webp 300w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262936/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas4-768x405.webp 768w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262932/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas4-104x55.webp 104w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262933/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapCanvas4-200x105.webp 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 774px) 100vw, 774px\" /></b></p>\n<p><b>Sub-object Views Enhanced</b></p>\n<p>Properties of the sub-objects can now be viewed on the master object. On the blueprint of the master object a new toggle for sub-object modules called ‘Enable Properties Navigation’ is introduced and can be enabled for easy properties navigation for sub-objects.</p>\n<p><b><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1688 size-full\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262948/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/Sub-object-Toggle-300x281-1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"281\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262948/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/Sub-object-Toggle-300x281-1.webp 300w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262947/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/Sub-object-Toggle-300x281-1-59x55.webp 59w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262946/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/Sub-object-Toggle-300x281-1-200x187.webp 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></b></p>\n<p>The name of the sub-object instance is hyperlinked. Clicking on the sub-object instance name will take the user to the properties panel of the sub-object with all the tabs specific to the sub-object.</p>\n<p><b><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1689 size-full\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262952/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/SubClickProp-768x358-1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"358\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262952/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/SubClickProp-768x358-1.webp 768w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262951/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/SubClickProp-768x358-1-300x140.webp 300w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262949/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/SubClickProp-768x358-1-118x55.webp 118w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262950/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/SubClickProp-768x358-1-200x93.webp 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></b></p>\n<p><b>Help Texts</b></p>\n<p>Help Texts are introduced in this version which can be added to the properties screens and create from template screens.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1690 size-full\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262905/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/HelpText1-768x310-1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"310\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262905/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/HelpText1-768x310-1.webp 768w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262904/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/HelpText1-768x310-1-300x121.webp 300w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262902/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/HelpText1-768x310-1-136x55.webp 136w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262903/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/HelpText1-768x310-1-200x81.webp 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></p>\n<p>Multiple help texts can be added to a single screen and it can be formatted similar to rich text.</p>\n<p><b><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1691 size-full\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262909/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/HelpText2-768x298-1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"298\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262909/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/HelpText2-768x298-1.webp 768w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262908/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/HelpText2-768x298-1-300x116.webp 300w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262906/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/HelpText2-768x298-1-142x55.webp 142w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262907/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/HelpText2-768x298-1-200x78.webp 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></b></p>\n<p><b>Visualization Enhancements: </b></p>\n<p><b>Extended Canvas Configurations on Investments</b></p>\n<p>The options on the Investment canvas have been extended to include additional sub-objects. They can be added to the canvas with the help of a toggle on the blueprint of the investment.</p>\n<p><b><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1693 size-full\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262913/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/InvestmentCanvas-768x435-1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"435\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262913/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/InvestmentCanvas-768x435-1.webp 768w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262911/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/InvestmentCanvas-768x435-1-300x170.webp 300w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262912/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/InvestmentCanvas-768x435-1-97x55.webp 97w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262910/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/InvestmentCanvas-768x435-1-200x113.webp 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></b></p>\n<p><b>Extended Status Canvas Options</b></p>\n<p>In 16.1.3, chart widgets can be added to the Status canvas to create more effective reporting. Number Tile, Progress Ring, Pie Chart and Bar Chart widgets can be added to the canvas by simple drag and drop.</p>\n<p><b><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1694 size-full\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262945/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/StatusWidgets-768x394-1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"394\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262945/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/StatusWidgets-768x394-1.webp 768w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262944/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/StatusWidgets-768x394-1-300x154.webp 300w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262942/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/StatusWidgets-768x394-1-107x55.webp 107w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262943/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/StatusWidgets-768x394-1-200x103.webp 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></b></p>\n<p><b>Field Level Security Enhancements:</b></p>\n<p><b>Secure Attributes for Edit</b></p>\n<p>In this release, attributes can be secured to prevent edits on it by all users easily. A new group option ‘All User’ is now available in the Access View for fields that can be selected which will let the users view the field and secure it for edits.</p>\n<p><b><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1695 size-full\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262901/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/FLS-768x286-1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"286\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262901/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/FLS-768x286-1.webp 768w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262900/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/FLS-768x286-1-300x112.webp 300w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262898/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/FLS-768x286-1-148x55.webp 148w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262899/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/FLS-768x286-1-200x74.webp 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></b></p>\n<p><b>Notification Enhancements:</b></p>\n<p><b>Notify To-Do Owners</b></p>\n<p>Notifications can be triggered on To Dos using the notifications module and setting up simple rules. Select the target object as To Do. Create your notification content and message and select the recipient of the notification. You can also build conditions to trigger the notifications.</p>\n<p><b><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1696 size-full\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262918/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/NotifyGroup-768x620-1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"620\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262918/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/NotifyGroup-768x620-1.webp 768w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262916/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/NotifyGroup-768x620-1-300x242.webp 300w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262917/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/NotifyGroup-768x620-1-68x55.webp 68w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262915/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/NotifyGroup-768x620-1-200x161.webp 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></b></p>\n<p><b>Roadmap Enhancements:</b></p>\n<p><b>Set Sync Schedule</b></p>\n<p>Set up a sync schedule on the roadmaps to synchronize data between the roadmap and investments at the desired frequency. In the schedule choose the days of sync, time of sync, duration of the sync schedule, and attributes to be synched during the run.</p>\n<p><b><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1698 size-full\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262941/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapScheduleGroup-768x373-2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262941/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapScheduleGroup-768x373-2.webp 768w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262940/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapScheduleGroup-768x373-2-300x146.webp 300w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262938/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapScheduleGroup-768x373-2-113x55.webp 113w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262939/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/RoadmapScheduleGroup-768x373-2-200x97.webp 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></b></p>\n<p><b>Swimlane Groups</b></p>\n<p>Group the swimlanes on roadmaps using the swimlane groups selector in the view options. Expand/collapse the swimlane groups and swimlanes to view the required roadmap items.</p>\n<p><b><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1699 size-full\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262958/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/Swimlanegrp-1024x514-1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"514\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262958/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/Swimlanegrp-1024x514-1.webp 1024w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262956/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/Swimlanegrp-1024x514-1-300x151.webp 300w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262956/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/Swimlanegrp-1024x514-1-768x386.webp 768w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262953/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/Swimlanegrp-1024x514-1-110x55.webp 110w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262954/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/Swimlanegrp-1024x514-1-200x100.webp 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></b></p>\n<p><b>Configure Badges</b></p>\n<p>The Metric field in Timeline view has been renamed to Badges with including financial metrics and lookups. Select up to 3 badges that are shown in the roadmap timeline.</p>\n<p><b><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1700 size-full\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262897/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/Badgesgrp-768x393-1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"393\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262897/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/Badgesgrp-768x393-1.webp 768w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262896/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/Badgesgrp-768x393-1-300x154.webp 300w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262893/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/Badgesgrp-768x393-1-107x55.webp 107w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ddcx08e0s/image/upload/v1788262894/albatroz/blog/uploads/2023/08/Badgesgrp-768x393-1-200x102.webp 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></b></p>\n<p><b>Author:</b> Kalyan P (Services Architect) &amp; Gayathri Gupta (Practice Lead)<br />\n<b>Contact us:</b><br />\nFor any questions or inquiries about our PPM service offerings please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:info@albatrozsolutions.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">sales@albatrozsolutions.com</a></p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                                <a href=\"https://albatrozsolutions.com/contact-us/\" style=\"margin-top: 15px;text-align:center;width: auto;\" class=\"banner-btn request_service_button pt-3 cta_btn\">Contact Us</a>\n                            </div>\n        